WEBVTT

00:37:59.045 --> 00:38:01.037
it's on LinkedIn if people want it --

00:38:01.061 --> 00:38:02.886
that you need to restructure it.

00:38:02.910 --> 00:38:05.799
Now we are restructuring it, OK?

00:38:05.823 --> 00:38:10.434
It's the inevitable consequence
of what we're doing here.

00:38:10.458 --> 00:38:11.672
We will come out of that.

00:38:11.696 --> 00:38:13.887
There has been a tremendous
transfer of wealth,

00:38:13.911 --> 00:38:15.625
whether people realize it or not,

00:38:15.649 --> 00:38:19.113
through the production
of all of that borrowed money.

00:38:19.542 --> 00:38:21.391
And all of that producing of money,

00:38:21.415 --> 00:38:23.407
that is a big force.

00:38:23.431 --> 00:38:24.645
We will come out of here,

00:38:24.669 --> 00:38:28.608
and the thing we will talk about
over the next couple of years,

00:38:28.632 --> 00:38:31.061
and probably sooner rather than later,